# The clini agent's id and a publishable key for it whose allowed origins are
# https://www.clini.cl, https://clini.cl and https://agenda-web.clini.cl (the
# host pages: content.js runs in the page's world, so its fetch carries the
# page's Origin). Neither is committed: this repo is public.
VOQALIZE_AGENT_ID=
VOQALIZE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# The control plane the widget mints its session against. Dev by default.
VOQALIZE_API_BASE=https://app.dev.voqalize.com/api/v1
